		"E525\trename one of the methods, or make the signatures the same.\n" +
		"E601\tuse a per-core global (`mut hits i64`), a `const`, a `shared let` holding an `atomic.Int` for a counter every core bumps, or send the data to the core that owns it with `relay`.\n" +
		"E602\tspawn the work as a child of a scope, or run it per core with `hearth`.\n" +
		"E603\tcopy what you need into a local value and change that, keep a per-core copy in a `mut` global, or use an `atomic.Int` or `atomic.Bool` for a counter or flag every core changes.\n" +
